# YouTube Scheduler - Environment & Credentials
# 
# This directory requires the following files:
#
# 1. client_secret.json
#    Download from Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials
#    (OAuth 2.0 Client ID → Desktop app → Download JSON)
#
# 2. token.json (auto-generated)
#    Created automatically when you run: npm run auth
#
# No .env file is needed — credentials are stored in the JSON files above.
# 
# IMPORTANT: Never commit client_secret.json or token.json to git!
